(21, 'App\\Models\\Student', 6, 'payment', 'Room Booking Submitted 🏠', 'Your booking request for Room 1 in Male has been received. We are currently verifying your payment of ₦85,000.00. You will be notified once an admin approves your booking and assigns your room.', '{\"payment_id\":3,\"room_id\":7}', NULL, '2026-03-28 15:40:13', '2026-03-28 15:40:13'),
